WEBVTT

00:22:00.163 --> 00:22:05.038
I figured out by reading something
that I had to take the ACT test.

00:22:05.496 --> 00:22:09.371
Nobody talked to me about it. I paid for
it myself. I drove myself there.

00:22:09.371 --> 00:22:13.079
I took the test. I didn't study
for it because I was told,

00:22:13.079 --> 00:22:16.871
you can't study for that test. You just go
. And it's like an aptitude test.

00:22:17.413 --> 00:22:20.163
I don't know what score I got because
it didn't even matter to me.

00:22:20.163 --> 00:22:22.371
I just took the test, did my best,

00:22:22.746 --> 00:22:28.121
and I went to I put in my application
to one school and and

00:22:28.121 --> 00:22:31.246
I applied to this one school because
it was a small school.